            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "Betongakuten is a supplier and consultant to the construction industry, with a strong focus on concrete, surface protection, geotechnics, concrete pumps, drilling rigs and related products. Over the years we have established ourselves as a resource for contractors, designers and specifiers, thanks to our extensive knowledge and experience."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "Betongakuten’s toolbox has grown large over the years. Our aim is to be a sounding board when it comes to information about products and how they are used. Wherever you are in the construction process, Betongakuten can help you with high-quality products and invaluable knowledge. We are more than just a supplier – we are a partner that helps you succeed with your construction project."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "We help with advice on the following products:"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "cement",
                "concrete",
                "impregnation",
                "grouting",
                "surface coatings",
                "surface protection",
                "geotechnics",
                "assembly supports",
                "trench shoring",
                "silos",
                "concrete pumps",
                "drilling rigs",
                "wire saws",
                "non-explosive rock splitting",
                "slope stabilisation"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "html": "Don’t hesitate to ask – we solve most things. <a href=\"/kontakta-oss\">Contact us.</a>"
            }
